      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261214">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261216">SSE</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261218">Compare low single precision floating-point values in xmm1 and xmm2/mem32 and set the EFLAGS flags accordingly.</para>
      </td>
