      <para unique="1261680">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+773481"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261682">Compare low single precision floating-point values in xmm1 and xmm2/mem32 and set the EFLAGS flags accordingly.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
